## ISSUES ENCOUNTERED AND RESOLVED

Issue 1: Marquez healthcheck returning 404
  Endpoint /api/v1/health does not exist in Marquez v0.47.0
  Fix: Changed healthcheck to /api/v1/namespaces (returns 200)
  Affected: docker-compose.yml healthcheck, LineageClient health check,
            tab_lineage.py _marquez_healthy()

Issue 2: Marquez DB credentials missing from .env
  MARQUEZ_DB_USER / MARQUEZ_DB_PASSWORD not defined
  Fix: Hardcoded 'marquez'/'marquez' in docker-compose.yml (demo values)

Issue 3: init-postgres.sql failed to create marquez/mlflow databases
  \gexec pattern (conditional CREATE DATABASE) failed silently
  Root cause: postgres data volume already existed from first run with broken script
  Fix 1: Simplified init SQL to plain CREATE DATABASE/ROLE statements
  Fix 2: Applied missing databases manually via 'podman exec postgres psql'
         for the existing data volume (no volume wipe needed)

Issue 4: UnicodeEncodeError in test output (Windows cp1252 console)
  Unicode checkmark char U+2713 not encodable in cp1252
  Fix: Replaced all unicode chars in test output with ASCII equivalents
